          <div class="wa-feature-item">
            <div class="wa-feature-check">✓</div>
            <p class="wa-feature-text"><strong>Predictable and reliable</strong> — perfect for bookings, order status, support tickets, and lead capture forms</p>
          </div>
          <div class="wa-feature-item">
            <div class="wa-feature-check">✓</div>
            <p class="wa-feature-text"><strong>Fast to deploy</strong> — built and live in days, not weeks</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div id="tab-ai" class="wa-feature-list" style="display:none;">
          <div class="wa-feature-item">
            <div class="wa-feature-check">✓</div>
            <p class="wa-feature-text"><strong>Claude API integration</strong> — human-like, context-aware responses that adapt to any question your customers ask</p>
          </div>
          <div class="wa-feature-item">
            <div class="wa-feature-check">✓</div>
            <p class="wa-feature-text"><strong>Trained on your business</strong> — knows your products, pricing, policies, and tone of voice</p>
          </div>
          <div class="wa-feature-item">
            <div class="wa-feature-check">✓</div>
            <p class="wa-feature-text"><strong>Closes deals autonomously</strong> — qualifies leads, overcomes objections, and books appointments without you</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href="#cta-banner" class="btn btn-primary">Build My WhatsApp Bot →</a>
      </div>

      <div class="chat-mockup fade-in fade-in-delay-2">
        <div class="chat-header">
          <div class="chat-avatar">F</div>
          <div>
            <div class="chat-name">Flowbit Assistant</div>
            <div class="chat-status">● Online — responding instantly</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="chat-body">
          <div class="msg received">
            Hi! 👋 Thanks for reaching out. I'm the Flowbit assistant — how can I help you today?
            <div class="msg-time">09:41 AM</div>
          </div>
          <div class="msg sent">
            Hi, I'm interested in automating my client follow-ups. We're losing leads because we respond too slowly.
            <div class="msg-time">09:42 AM</div>
          </div>
          <div class="typing-indicator">
            <div class="typing-dot"></div>
            <div class="typing-dot"></div>
            <div class="typing-dot"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="msg received">
            That's a very common problem — and one we fix all the time! With our lead follow-up automation, your new enquiries get a personalised reply in under 60 seconds, 24/7. 🚀
            <br><br>Would you like to book a free 30-minute audit to see exactly what we'd build for you?
            <div class="msg-time">09:42 AM</div>
          </div>
          <div class="msg sent">
            Yes, that sounds great!
            <div class="msg-time">09:43 AM</div>
          </div>
          <div class="msg received">
            Perfect! Here's my calendar — pick a time that works for you 👇<br><br>
            📅 <span style="color:var(--accent);text-decoration:underline;">flowbit.co/book</span>
            <div class="msg-time">09:43 AM</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

