<!-- ─── FAQ ─── -->
<section id="faq" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="faq-header fade-in">
      <div class="section-tag">FAQ</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Questions You're<br><span class="highlight">Probably Thinking</span></h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Everything you need to know before we start automating your business.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item fade-in">
        <div class="faq-question">
          What exactly is a custom automation?
          <div class="faq-arrow">+</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">A custom automation is code we build specifically for your business that handles a repetitive task without any human involvement. Unlike off-the-shelf tools like Zapier (which just connect apps), we write the actual logic, intelligence, and workflows tailored to how YOUR business operates. The result feels purpose-built — because it is.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
        <div class="faq-question">
          How long does it take to build and go live?
          <div class="faq-arrow">+</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">Most automations are live within 5–10 business days after our discovery call. Simpler flows (like a WhatsApp lead capture) can be done in 2–3 days. More complex systems with AI integration and multiple tool connections typically take 1–2 weeks. We give you a clear timeline after the initial audit.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item fade-in fade-in-delay-2">
        <div class="faq-question">
          Do I need to be technical to work with Flowbit?
          <div class="faq-arrow">+</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">Not at all. You just need to know your business and its pain points. We handle all the technical implementation. You'll never need to look at a line of code — we explain everything in plain language and train your team on how to use the system we build.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item fade-in fade-in-delay-3">
        <div class="faq-question">
          What if I want changes after the automation is live?
          <div class="faq-arrow">+</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">Your monthly retainer includes ongoing support and iterations. As your business evolves, we update your automations. Minor tweaks (wording changes, new responses) are handled within 24–48 hours. Larger feature additions are scoped and priced transparently before we build.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item fade-in">
        <div class="faq-question">
          Do you use AI or pre-programmed logic?
          <div class="faq-arrow">+</div>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">Both — and we help you choose the right approach. Pre-programmed logic is faster, cheaper, and more predictable (great for structured workflows like bookings or FAQs). AI integration (using the Claude API) is better when you need natural, dynamic conversations that handle anything a customer might say. Many clients use a combination of both.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ─── CTA BANNER ─── -->
